{"id":88002101600964,"type":"artist","name":"Ryoji Ikeda","artist":null,"year":1966,"weight":16,"info":{"tags":["glitch","minimal","noise","experimental","electronic"],"country":"FR","begin":"1966-07-08","kind":"Person","similar":["Frank Bretschneider","Alva Noto","SND","Fennesz","Autechre","Oval","Vladislav Delay","Alva Noto + Ryuichi Sakamoto","Jan Jelinek","Mika Vainio"],"img":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Transmediale-2010-Ryoji_Ikeda-Data-Tron-1.jpg?width=500","bio":"El trabajo de este artista sonoro japonés se caracteriza por una ilimitada búsqueda al interior de la estructura del sonido, a través de su manipulación numérica. Usando la tecnología informática hasta sus límites, Ikeda ha desarrollado toda una  serie de métodos \"microscópicos\" para componer y construir sus interfaces, espacializaciones, experimentos acústicos y audiovisuales. Desde 1995 ha sido uno de los artistas más intensamente involucrados en el arte sonoro"},"works":[{"id":211563049953034,"type":"album","name":"1000 Fragments","artist":"Ryoji Ikeda","year":1995,"weight":3,"yt":"uvSLLyePrRk","src":"musthear","from":{"books":[],"podcasts":[],"lists":[{"id":276217932702925,"name":"RYM Top — Electronic — Micromontage","rank":15,"scaruffi":null}],"n_lists":1}},{"id":108191610267564,"type":"album","name":"0°C","artist":"Ryoji Ikeda","year":1998,"weight":5,"yt":"mVeMvd2zmQI","src":"musthear","from":{"books":[],"podcasts":[],"lists":[{"id":158916115598774,"name":"RYM Top — Electronic — Glitch","rank":163,"scaruffi":null},{"id":276217932702925,"name":"RYM Top — Electronic — Micromontage","rank":9,"scaruffi":null}],"n_lists":2}},{"id":152830187916254,"type":"album","name":"Music for Installations Vol. 1","artist":"Ryoji Ikeda","year":2000,"weight":5,"yt":"gygBjk81APQ","src":"musthear","from":{"books":[],"podcasts":[],"lists":[{"id":250387862480957,"name":"RYM Top — Experimental — Sound Art","rank":131,"scaruffi":null},{"id":276217932702925,"name":"RYM Top — Electronic — Microm